   "text": "Thank you, Sofia. You're verified, and I found your Green Bowl order O-5111. It was delivered today and includes a Berry smoothie.\n\nI can't issue a refund or credit for this myself. Your account has had several refunds in the last 30 days, and our policy requires a specialist to review a case like that. I've sent your report to a specialist, with the order details and the missing smoothie. They'll follow up with you within 24 hours. I can't promise what they'll decide.\n\nI'm sorry for the trouble. Is there anything else I can help with?"
