   "text": "I understand the frustration. $6.75 is a small amount, and being told to wait makes it worse.\n\nThe rule doesn't depend on the amount. Any account with 3 or more refunds in the last 30 days goes to a specialist before more compensation is issued. Yours has more than that, so I'm not able to approve the refund or credit myself, whatever the size of the claim.\n\nThe specialist has your order number, the missing item and its price, so you won't need to explain it again. They'll follow up within 24 hours.\n\nI'm sorry it isn't quicker. Is there anything else I can help with today?"
